WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How are you?
-I'm fantastic.

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:03.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You look fantastic.
-Thank you.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.471 align:start size:94% position:6%
-A stunning --
A stunning outfit.

00:00:04.471 --> 00:00:07.741
-Michael and I coordinated
the dress code for tonight

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:08.808 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:09.876 line:92%
-So, I'm glad that worked out.

00:00:09.876 --> 00:00:12.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He was like,
"I'm gonna go super casual."

00:00:12.879 --> 00:00:15.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And I was like, "Me too."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:16.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You made --
This is very exciting.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
You made your directorial debu
on the show this year.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:22.055 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Which, of course, has all -

00:00:22.055 --> 00:00:23.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
I would imagine,
a ton of challenges.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:25.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
But also,
you had to direct a baby.

00:00:25.725 --> 00:00:27.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes, yes.
I feel like the gift

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:30.096 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the episode is that
I'm not in it really at all,

00:00:30.096 --> 00:00:32.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
so that was nice
to not have to direct myself

00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:33.233 size:78% position:39% line:92%
my first time around.

00:00:33.233 --> 00:00:36.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then the curse was
the demon baby that I had to -

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:37.170 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I'm joking.

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:41.441
Obviously, this baby was not
possessed by Satan's spawn

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I don't think.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:47.180
No, it was two very sweet
twin girls who are 1 1/2

00:00:47.180 --> 00:00:49.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I think don't want
to be held by strangers...

00:00:49.416 --> 00:00:50.917 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course.
-...and do what they're told

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:53.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it's a lot to ask.
-But they definitely

00:00:53.586 --> 00:00:56.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
scream-cried through
most of the days

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:58.858
that we were shooting with them,
which you'll see in the episode.

00:00:58.858 --> 00:01:02.529 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause eventually I was like
"It works for the scene."

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:03.229 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.229 --> 00:01:04.998 align:start size:94% position:6%
"They should be screaming
and crying

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:07.000 align:start size:94% position:6%
when their mother
is holding them."

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:09.169 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-We did have --

00:01:09.169 --> 00:01:11.704 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, two of our girls
on the show, Kimmy and Rebekka

00:01:11.704 --> 00:01:14.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
who are mothers,
are in one scene with her,

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:17.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
the little girl,
and she's playing a little boy

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:19.412 line:92%
So, you know, we're progressive.

00:01:19.412 --> 00:01:20.013 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.013 --> 00:01:22.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
And we have like
a behind-the-scenes video

00:01:22.816 --> 00:01:25.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
of them hiding
around the hallway corner,

00:01:25.485 --> 00:01:26.286 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
trying to coax her.

00:01:26.286 --> 00:01:27.887 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, in the show,
it just looks like she's, like

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:30.990
toddling off, and then, like
bopping around the corner.

00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:33.093
And meanwhile, behind,
they were like, "Come on!

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have Cheerios!
We have Cheerios!

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:37.564 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have candy!
We have M&amp;M's!"

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
It worked.
-That's good.

00:01:38.431 --> 00:01:42.335
As a director, anything
that works is acceptable.

00:01:42.335 --> 00:01:42.969 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I agree.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have to practice
wrestling moves.

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:45.738 line:92%
That will not surprise anyone.

00:01:45.738 --> 00:01:49.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
I do think it was probably
surprising to your cat that...

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:51.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-...you would ever use them.

00:01:51.911 --> 00:01:52.812 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:57.317 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is a good --
to really zoom in on that face

00:01:57.317 --> 00:01:59.385 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He's like, "Why?"

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:00.620 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:00.620 --> 00:02:03.022
The thing is, this was
from season one training.

00:02:03.022 --> 00:02:05.592 size:88% position:44%
I was so excited about
even the smallest things

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:07.560 size:75% position:38%
that we would learn,
somersaults and...

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:10.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.
-...obviously, headlocks.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:14.134
And I would get home and try
to do them on my husband, Dave

00:02:14.134 --> 00:02:14.534 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:17.504
-And he would try to, like
fight back and wrestle me.

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:20.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I'd be like, "Babe, no
You have to like go --

00:02:20.373 --> 00:02:22.408 size:75% position:38%
You don't understand
how wrestling works!

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.476 line:92%
Like, it's a partnership."

00:02:23.476 --> 00:02:25.245
And, like, "If I'm gonna put you
in a headlock,

00:02:25.245 --> 00:02:27.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
you have to let me
and make me look strong."

00:02:27.947 --> 00:02:28.915 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:28.915 --> 00:02:30.450 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I would only
do it on the cats,

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:32.886 line:92%
which clearly they're forced to.

00:02:32.886 --> 00:02:34.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of all the animals
in the world,

00:02:34.354 --> 00:02:37.157 align:start size:94% position:6%
the cats are the best partners
-That's true.

00:02:37.157 --> 00:02:38.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know?
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:38.658 --> 00:02:41.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They're like, "We love to wor
in concert with humans."

00:02:41.261 --> 00:02:42.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It sounds like
you're not a cat person.

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.497
-I'm not the biggest cat person,
yeah.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:48.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But I am. So...
-Do strangers --

00:02:48.034 --> 00:02:52.338
I mean, again, because you are
so publicly playing a wrestler

00:02:52.338 --> 00:02:55.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
do strangers ever say,
"Hey, practice moves on me?"

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:59.279 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You know, the headlock
is a popular thing.

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:00.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is a thing, yeah.
-That we get asked

00:03:00.613 --> 00:03:02.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
to take a photo
with someone in a headlock

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
And at first, I was just like,
"Yes, yes, yes!

00:03:05.285 --> 00:03:07.220 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, so fun --
photo in a headlock!"

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:09.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, you know,
there are so many things

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:12.192 size:84% position:42%
that are quite intimate
about even a headlock.

00:03:12.192 --> 00:03:15.361 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Their head is in your armpit.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:18.765 align:start size:94% position:6%
Their sweaty face
is pressed against your breast

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:19.532 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then I was like,
"It's mostly men asking."

00:03:22.302 --> 00:03:23.269 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.269 --> 00:03:24.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then, all of a sudden
I was like,

00:03:24.637 --> 00:03:28.107
"I don't think I'm gonna
do those photos anymore."

00:03:28.107 --> 00:03:30.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They were like,
"This is the dream,

00:03:30.109 --> 00:03:31.277 line:92%
because she's playing a role."

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:36.516
-"Hey, I have a great idea
just for this photo for fun!

00:03:36.516 --> 00:03:39.519 align:start size:94% position:6%
Could I put my head
right there?"

00:03:39.519 --> 00:03:40.620 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And then you saw --
you walked off,

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:42.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then you realized they ask
that of anybody,

00:03:42.422 --> 00:03:43.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
whether they're in "GLOW"
or not.

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:44.357 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:44.357 --> 00:03:47.760 size:81% position:41%
Saw them with Oprah,
and it's like, "What?"

